Date: Fri, 11 Sep 2026 06:04:40 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Rename to Contributions, add sort/search, pie chart, SGD
 realized P/L

- Rename /portfolio -> /contributions (nav label + route); old /portfolio
  URL redirects to the new one
- Contributions: pivot table now shows most recent month first
- Contributions: new 'Add default month' bulk action next to 'Record a
  deposit' that pre-fills the standard 500/500/200/500/500 split
  (Chin at 200, everyone else 500, matching the historical pattern) for
  the next calendar month after the latest recorded one; amounts are
  editable before saving, and posts all stakeholders in one request
- Contributions: 'By stakeholder' is now a pie chart (CSS conic-gradient,
  no new dependency) with a legend showing amount + percent per person,
  replacing the old table
- All table headers/cells are center-aligned by default now (was a
  left-aligned header sitting above right-aligned numbers, which read as
  misaligned) - removed the per-column text-right/text-left overrides
  across every table
- Completed Trades: realized P/L now defaults to SGD instead of USD,
  via a new generic convertCurrency() helper in lib/fx.ts
- Transactions, Open Positions (all 3 sub-tabs), and Completed Trades
  each get a search box (ticker/region/notes) and clickable sortable
  column headers, via two new shared pieces: components/SortableTh.tsx
  and lib/use-sortable.ts
